      "name": "operation_submit",
      "description": "Queue fixed syntax validation, managed documentation repair, or a separately installed and approved iCloud release. validate_icloud_deployment observes preconditions; deploy_icloud_manual_auth changes only the sealed iCloud files and stops/starts the fixed Home Assistant container; contain_icloud_manual_auth suspends iCloud without restoring unsafe authentication and requires target_operation_id. No free paths, commands, containers or credentials. Use the same idempotency key after response loss and operation_status to observe; never repeat unknown effects with another key. recover_git_backup_once is inert until a separately approved incident/tree plan is armed. Fixed Git-only worker; preserves scanner/hooks; never replays uncertain outcomes.",
